  "label": "Anti-Semitic Stereotypes",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the historical and ongoing anti-Semitic stereotypes that have been used to dehumanize and vilify Jewish people, which Hitler exploited to justify his genocidal policies. The background knowledge required is the understanding that Hitler's ideology was rooted in anti-Semitism, and that the meme's use of 'hero' is a direct attack on the historical and moral legacy of anti-Semitism and its catastrophic consequences.",
